# The annual appraisal-district drops are gigabytes of source data consumed
# only by scripts/, never by the app. They are gitignored, so a git-linked
# deployment never sees them — but `vercel deploy` from a working copy that has
# them will happily upload 1.5 GB. This stops that.
/data-drop/

# Nothing under scripts/ runs at build or request time. The rate tables and the
# parcel footprint they produce are already committed or already in the
# database.
/scripts/
